    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent to investigate an abandoned apartment, you are tasked with documenting strange occurrences using the <strong>A.D.D. (Anomaly Detection Device)</strong>\u2014a specialized tool capable of detecting and repairing irregularities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510310/extras/6094c9e5aaf0fdcb7c085c514ba81eea.poster.avif?t=1743807006\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510310/extras/6094c9e5aaf0fdcb7c085c514ba81eea.webm?t=1743807006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510310/extras/6094c9e5aaf0fdcb7c085c514ba81eea.mp4?t=1743807006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the apartment seems perfectly normal, but as you explore, reality starts to shift.\u00a0Objects move on their own, shadows flicker unpredictably, and unnatural occurrences manifest around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a loop in which you must identify all anomalies in the apartment to progress to the next one. Missing even a single anomaly will send you back to the previous floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to address every anomaly you encounter and find a way out of\u00a0<strong>Flat 9</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological horror game that may contain jump scares and intense moments. Player discretion is advised.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-60\u00a0minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to spot differences is key to overcoming the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies are easy to detect, while others are more subtle and require closer observation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performance Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter frame lag or stuttering during gameplay, you can adjust your graphic settings to improve performance. Reducing these settings can lead to a smoother experience, allowing you to fully enjoy the game without interruptions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent to investigate an abandoned apartment, you are tasked with documenting strange occurrences using the <strong>A.D.D. (Anomaly Detection Device)</strong>\u2014a specialized tool capable of detecting and repairing irregularities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510310/extras/6094c9e5aaf0fdcb7c085c514ba81eea.poster.avif?t=1743807006\" width=600 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510310/extras/6094c9e5aaf0fdcb7c085c514ba81eea.webm?t=1743807006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510310/extras/6094c9e5aaf0fdcb7c085c514ba81eea.mp4?t=1743807006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the apartment seems perfectly normal, but as you explore, reality starts to shift.\u00a0Objects move on their own, shadows flicker unpredictably, and unnatural occurrences manifest around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a loop in which you must identify all anomalies in the apartment to progress to the next one. Missing even a single anomaly will send you back to the previous floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to address every anomaly you encounter and find a way out of\u00a0<strong>Flat 9</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a psychological horror game that may contain jump scares and intense moments. Player discretion is advised.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-60\u00a0minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to spot differences is key to overcoming the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies are easy to detect, while others are more subtle and require closer observation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performance Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter frame lag or stuttering during gameplay, you can adjust your graphic settings to improve performance. Reducing these settings can lead to a smoother experience, allowing you to fully enjoy the game without interruptions.</p>",
    "short_description": "A psychological horror set in a deserted apartment, where you're trapped in a relentless cycle. Armed with a strange device, you must find and report every anomaly to escape. Can you make it past Flat 9?",
